{{#> layout title="We have your message" preheader=(concat "Thanks for writing to " appName ". A person will answer by email.") reason="because you wrote to us"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">Thanks for writing. A person reads every message and will answer by email. This is what you sent:</p>
{{#> note}}<span style="white-space:pre-wrap;">{{description}}</span>{{/note}}
<p style="margin:24px 0 0 0;">The {{appName}} team</p>
{{/layout}}
